// SW5, the endgame pool (plans/ending-spec.html section 9): said only after you choose to stay. Every line is
// gated by the bare condition "endgame" (EN2 adds it to the line filter, section 22); "endgame:early" marks the
// lines that only make sense in the first two weeks after you stay (RV21).

== chat
? endgame:early
- Ah. The one who stayed. The night bridge approves. The night bridge is me.   #funny
? endgame:early
- I read the end of your story first. Risk management. Glad it ended here.   #funny
? endgame
- Quiet hours on the bridge now. Stars, the hum, a cold tea. Come up some night.
- Ordinary nights are the good ones. Nothing to log but the time.
? endgame tier>=friend
- Some nights the bridge is just me and the stars. You're welcome to make it three.   #warm

